{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm48mohnevc0","created":1791948221658,"text":"决策树"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mtjb28w0","created":1791948232642,"text":"基本流程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48mwlwtd40","created":1791948239330,"text":"目的"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48na9m2xs0","created":1791948269061,"text":"决策树学习的目的是生成一颗泛化性能强的决策树。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm48nh10sew0","created":1791948283779,"text":"过程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm48nk37hdc0","created":1791948290442,"text":"当前结点样本全部属于同一类别，直接标记为叶结点；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48no17s8g0","created":1791948299028,"text":"属性集为空，或者所有样本在剩余属性取值完全相同，无法划分：叶结点标记为该结点样本中数量最多的类别；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm48ns2fy140","created":1791948307810,"text":"当前结点包含的样本集合为空，不能划分。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}